<workout_file>
	<author>TrainerDay - pascalkolkman</author>
	<name>Strength Development SHORT tri WKO 1 v2019</name>
	<description>4x [5x2min=8min] ramp up blocks where the cadence is kept low (60-75 rpm), 
with relative easy intensity (78-84% of FTP) Zone 3 in stead of 5 blocks. Total 01h:04min.
Followed by 2 min recovery at higher 95 RPM at 50 to 55 % ftp.
Great training to Start a taper progressive training kind of series with or to do with kind of tired legs or for beginners.
To decrease training  time 10 min from 75 min to 65 min you could do 4 low rpm blocks in stead of 5.</description>
	<sportType>bike</sportType>
	<tags>
		<tag name="trainerDay"/>
	</tags>
